      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-SCOPE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "把“两处背阴空地”“相似条件”等限定词标出来。局部记录能支持局部表述，不能自动换成“所有社区空地”或任何不同条件。",
      "record_sha256": "e5408a99556e903d9f8d210050df1252f6f8ff85936a8c6ad927f6bb4194af5e"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-CAUSE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：同时出现不等于单一原因",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.detail_inference.causality"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "independence_group": "detail-cause-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "release_ready",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "看到两个变化和一个结果同时出现，只能先说它们共同出现。若文本没有比较、控制或明确因果说明，不能把其中一项写成“唯一原因”或“必然导致”。",
      "record_sha256": "d9a8f222a636a77ec6e0ddc02f1f27ff78c2f1f99b033425f14ebdf83d69623c"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-ABS",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：把“必然、所有、唯一”逐个核对",
